% found that prints LEVELS of excess kurtosis for individual corporate
% bonds, and it is a working paper by authors whose closely related
% published paper -- Bai, Bali and Wen, JFE 131(3):619--642 (2019),
% built on the same return dataset -- was RETRACTED in 2023 over data
% construction errors (bai2023retraction), following the replication
% work in dickerson2023priced. The qualitative finding (individual
% corporate bond monthly returns are strongly leptokurtic; normality is
% rejected for most bonds) is not in dispute and is corroborated
% elsewhere. The numeric quintile levels should be quoted as
% indicative and attributed, never as a settled empirical constant.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------

